Select  xx."ItemCode", xx."CodeBars",xx."ItemName",xx."ItmsGrpNam",xx."SubGroup",xx."SubSubGroup",xx."Brand",xx."InQty", xx."OutQty" ,xx."OnHand",xx."OrderedQty",(case when xx."InQty"=0 then 0 else xx."OutQty"/xx."InQty"*100 end) as "Movement",(select max(T."DocDate") FROM OPRQ T INNER JOIN PRQ1 T2 ON T."DocEntry" = T2."DocEntry" WHERE T2."ItemCode"=xx."ItemCode") as "LastLPurchaseRequestDate",(select max(T."DocDate") FROM OPOR T INNER JOIN POR1 T2 ON T."DocEntry" = T2."DocEntry" WHERE T2."ItemCode"=xx."ItemCode") as "LastLPODate",IFNULL((select max(T."DocDate") FROM OPDN T INNER JOIN PDN1 T2 ON T."DocEntry" = T2."DocEntry" WHERE T2."ItemCode"=xx."ItemCode" ),xx."LastPurDat") as "LastPurchaseDate",(select max("CardName") from (select Y."CardName",Row_Number() over  (partition by Y."DocEntry" order by Y."DocEntry" Desc) as "RN" from OPDN Y inner join PDN1 Z on Y."DocEntry"=Z."DocEntry" where Z."ItemCode"=xx."ItemCode" ) where "RN"=1) as "Last Purchased Vendor"  FROM (SELECT v."ItemCode", v."CodeBars",v."ItemName",T1."ItmsGrpNam", ifnull(v."U_VSubGroup",'') as "SubGroup",  ifnull(v."U_VSubSubGroup",'') as "SubSubGroup", ifnull(v."U_BRAND",'') as "Brand",(Case when v."ItmsGrpCod" in ('105','106') then IFNULL((select sum(T0."InQty"-T0."OutQty") FROM OINM T0 WHERE T0."ItemCode"=v."ItemCode" and T0."TransType" in ('18','20','59') and T0."DocDate">=ADD_DAYS(CURRENT_DATE,-60) and T0."DocDate"<=Current_Date),0) else  IFNULL((select sum(T0."InQty"-T0."OutQty") FROM OINM T0 WHERE T0."ItemCode"=v."ItemCode" and T0."TransType" in ('18','20') and T0."DocDate">=ADD_DAYS(CURRENT_DATE,-60) and T0."DocDate"<=Current_Date),0) end) as "InQty", IFNULL((select sum(T0."OutQty"-T0."InQty") FROM OINM T0 WHERE T0."ItemCode"=v."ItemCode" and T0."TransType" in ('13','14') and T0."DocDate">=ADD_DAYS(CURRENT_DATE,-60) and T0."DocDate"<=Current_Date),0) as "OutQty" ,v."OnHand",v."LastPurDat",IFNULL((select SUM(T2."OpenInvQty") FROM OPOR T INNER JOIN POR1 T2 ON T."DocEntry" = T2."DocEntry" WHERE T2."ItemCode"=v."ItemCode" and T."CANCELED"='N'),0) as "OrderedQty" FROM OITM v INNER JOIN OITB T1 on v."ItmsGrpCod" = T1."ItmsGrpCod"  ) xx  where (xx."OnHand")  <=6
